OL,3,GNEWSAStudent murdered by stepdad was 'a
OL,4,Abeautiful soul', flatmates say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student murdered by her "sexually
OL,7,Fobsessed" stepfather has been
OL,8,Fremembered as a "beautiful and gentle
OL,9,Fsoul" by her flatmates following his
OL,10,Fsentencing.
OL,12,FCarla Georgescu was killed by Nathan
OL,13,FOwens, 34, in her room at the
OL,14,FUniversity of Lancashire in Preston, in
OL,15,FFebruary.
OL,17,FOn Friday Owens was jailed for a
OL,18,Fminimum of 35 years after killing Carla
OL,19,Fon what was her 20th birthday.
